---
source: crates/bingo-surface-tui/src/view.rs
expression: "draw_sized(100, 28, &state, &mut ui, now)"
---
"write                                              turn                                             "
"enter        send · open focused block             esc          sheet → card → dropdown → interrupt "
"shift+enter  newline (ctrl+j · alt+enter · \       esc esc      rewind to an earlier turn           "
"enter)                                             ctrl+c       stop · clear · twice exits          "
"ctrl+a/e     line start/end (home · end)           ctrl+d       exit on an empty input              "
"alt+b/f      move one word                         ctrl+t       show/hide tasks                     "
"ctrl+w/u/k   delete word · to start · to end       tab          complete → queue → next row         "
"move                                               shift+tab    cycle permission mode               "
"up/down      history at first/last input line      1-9 · y/a/n  answer the open dialog              "
"pgup/pgdn    scroll the transcript                 ctrl+e       expand preview                      "
"v · drag     select; arrows/drag extend;           ctrl+b       background running command          "
"y/ctrl+c/release copy                              sessions                                         "
"alt+p        cycle pane place                      down         sessions (empty input)              "
"ctrl+o       expand result · then all              ctrl+g       sessions · ↑↓ to walk               "
"click        a picture · open it                   ?            toggle this panel                   "
"                                                                                                    "
"/ for commands · ! for a shell line                                                                 "
